      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "I can't believe people just kick people because it gets too populated. thats sounds like something you should be able to control without having to kick somebody.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-02-23T09:13:52.108Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When kicking people from a world, change the button from just \"Kick\" to \"Kick and Report\" or remove the warning afterward that says something like \"You've been kicked for bad behavior, this has been reported to the moderators.\"\n\nI think a lot of people are using \"Kick\" just to clear people out of a world when it gets populated without realizing that it's reporting the person.  \n\nI have heard from some people that if you get kicked enough times, you get an automatic week-long ban.  I don't think this happens often enough to most people to initiate an auto-ban, but the possibility exists and some clarification on the button might be helpful.",
